# Stockwise-CRM — Sales & Inventory Operations Platform

Stockwise-CRM is a full-stack web app for small business sales and inventory workflows.

The project started as an inventory management system for tracking products, sales, restocks, suppliers, and low-stock alerts. It was later extended with a Customer Orders workspace so a small business can also track customer inquiries, sales opportunities, product-based quotes, follow-up tasks, and won/lost pipeline value before the order becomes an inventory movement.

The goal is not to replace a full ERP or enterprise CRM. It is a practical operations dashboard for a small team that wants one place to understand what is in stock, what needs attention, and which customer deals are currently in progress.

---

## Live deployment

- **Live app:** https://main.d28ujyj8pewvmb.amplifyapp.com
- **Backend API:** https://stockwise-crm-backend.onrender.com
- **Frontend hosting:** AWS Amplify
- **Backend hosting:** Render
- **Database:** Neon PostgreSQL
- **CORS:** Restricted to the deployed Amplify frontend domain

> Note: The backend is hosted on Render Free, so the first request may take a short time to wake up after inactivity.

