## What this project includes

### Inventory operations

- Inventory dashboard with product, stock, low-stock, and recent sales metrics
- Product catalog with SKU, category, stock quantity, reorder threshold, and unit price
- Sales recording workflow that decreases product stock
- Restock recording workflow that increases product stock
- Supplier tracking and supplier-linked restock history
- Rule-based inventory insights for low-stock items, days-left estimates, and suggested reorder quantities
- AI-style restock summaries that explain inventory signals in plain language

### Customer Orders & CRM pipeline

- Customer Orders workspace for customer inquiries and sales opportunities
- Customer profiles connected to leads and follow-up activities
- Lead pipeline with stages: New, Contacted, Qualified, Proposal, Won, and Lost
- Product-based quote builder using:

  ```text
  unit price × quantity - discount + delivery fee
Manual quote override for special cases such as bulk discounts, delivery fees, installation, or custom bundle pricing
Pipeline KPI cards for open opportunities, pending order value, upcoming follow-ups, won value, lost value, and customer count
Pipeline analytics for order outcomes, value by stage, stage breakdown, follow-up status, and best-selling products
Best-Selling Products card scoped to a rolling 7-day sales window so it matches the dashboard’s recent sales metric
Local demo reset scripts for inventory and CRM data with dry-run defaults and safety guards
